    <h2>1. Information Collection and Use</h2>
    <p>
      Sokoban Balls is designed to be played without requiring any personal information.
      We do not require user registration and do not knowingly collect personally identifiable data.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Personal Data</h2>
    <p>
      The Game does not collect, store, or share personal data such as name, email address,
