    </p>

    <h2>3. Device Information</h2>
    <p>
      We do not intentionally collect device identifiers or sensitive device information.
      Basic technical information may be processed automatically by the operating system
      for the purpose of running the Game properly.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Sokoban Balls does not use third-party analytics tools, advertising networks,
      or external SDKs that collect user data.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Children’s Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Game is not specifically directed at children under the age of 13.
      We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      If you believe that a child has provided personal data, please contact us so we can take appropriate action.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      Since no personal data is collected, stored, or transmitted by the Game,
      there is no risk of personal data leakage from our systems.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
